---
title: News
weight: 15
layout: page
override:tags: page
tags: page
pagination:
  data: collections.news
  size: 5
  reverse: true
---

See <a href="/news/archive/">the news archive</a> for a single-page listing of all available articles.

{% for post in pagination.items %}
<h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
<p class="byline">{{ post.date | date: "%Y-%m-%d", "UTC" }}{% if post.data.author %} by {{ post.data.author }}{% endif %}</p>
{% if forloop.first and pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}
{{ post.templateContent }}
{% elsif post.templateContent contains "<!-- more -->" %}
{{ post.templateContent | split: "<!-- more -->" | first }}

<p><a href="{{ post.url }}">Continue reading...</a></p>
{% else %}
{{ post.templateContent }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if pagination.href.previous or pagination.href.next %}
<nav class="pagination-nav" aria-label="News pagination">
  {% if pagination.href.previous %}
  <a class="pagination-newer" href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}">&laquo; Newer</a>
  {% endif %}
  {% if pagination.href.next %}
  <a class="pagination-older" href="{{ pagination.href.next }}">Older &raquo;</a>
  {% endif %}
</nav>
{% endif %}
